0..77 Comment "//! A reflexivity whose endpoint calls a definition that omits its implicits."
78..81 Comment "//!"
82..159 Comment "//! The checker solves such implicits from the types of the arguments, and it"
160..239 Comment "//! fills the declared type with the solutions. The kernel replays the relation"
240..305 Comment "//! that the checker decides at each endpoint of the filled type."
306..309 Comment "//!"
310..388 Comment "//! `stepImplicit` takes the carrier and the three points as implicits. A call"
389..466 Comment "//! writes only the two paths. `twoLevels` states a reflexivity one level up,"
467..544 Comment "//! so its endpoints hold that call. The checker forms the filled type again,"
545..606 Comment "//! and each reflexivity carries its dialogues to the kernel."
607..610 Comment "//!"
611..627 Comment "//! - see: #5521"
628..721 Comment "//! - see: `omitted-carrier-in-body.gandr` — a composite whose carrier the signature solves"
723..789 Comment "/// A composite of two paths, its carrier and its points implicit."
